  <item>
    <title>Vol.69当恋爱遇上玄学，是相信眼缘还是信命运？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/667564aec26e396a366a7087</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">667564aec26e396a366a7087</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 21 Jun 2024 11:31:58 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><em><strong><span>韩国恋综越来越颠，《出神入化的恋爱》又叫《着了魔恋爱》-最新潮恋爱综艺，看命理大师如何用专业技巧寻找真爱。不同于常规恋爱节目，这里的男女嘉宾都是玄学爱好者，用自己擅长的塔罗、八字等方式进行匹配。难道爱情真的可以通过玄学来预测吗？欢迎来到令人心动的offer之玄学季</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>｜时间线｜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="130">02:10</a>:参加玄学恋综的嘉宾都是职业算命大师吗还是会这门技术就行？八字风水/塔罗占卜/巫师/驱魔师/哪个更强？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="302">05:02</a>玄学恋综真会玩，看出生年月日选心动还是头一次听说。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="468">07:48</a>从日柱的天干地支看你的日柱动物是什么？</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsjJDpSpNykjDmLL-30f938aGi3n.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><br></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fop4-XGkwI8i2lO5-4Nd-mAMGWgb.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="864">14:24</a>见面后第一选择竟然四个男嘉宾都投给了同一个女嘉宾</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1209">20:09</a>你会选择符合自己眼缘的还是会选择八字跟自己合得来的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1586">26:26</a>:属相不合怎么办？真正的决定因素是相处，而不是属相</span></p><span></span><p><span>-------分割线-------</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：薇塔Vitamin</span></p><span></span><p><span>玛莎拉Marcella</span></p><span></span><p><span>｜互动方式｜</span></p><span></span><p><span>微博搜索@薇塔Vitamin</span></p><span></span><p><span>Instagram: vitamagic666</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎添加我微信（Vitamin821)</span></p><span></span><p><span>本节目招募嘉宾，欢迎语音文字形式投稿。</span></p><span></span><p><span>邮箱：986577856@qq.com</span></p><span></span><p><span>｜节目制作｜</span></p><span></span><p><span>logo设计/后期制作：薇塔</span></p><span></span><p><span>｜收听方式｜</span></p><span></span><p><span>国内：喜马拉雅，小宇宙，网易云音乐，</span></p><span></span><p><span>苹果播客，荔枝，qq音乐</span></p><span></span><p><span>海外：Spotify，Overcast，Pocket Casts</span></p>]]></description>
