    <title>Vol.68童年回忆杀-长大后的我们还能保持童心吗？【六一儿童节特辑】</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6659ea4694977a26ef5465cc</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6659ea4694977a26ef5465cc</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 31 May 2024 15:18:29 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><em><strong><span>今天，我们将带你穿越时光的隧道，回到那个无忧无虑的童年。从儿童节的小蛋糕到游乐场的欢笑声，从学校里的糗事一直到挑战老师的小勇气。长大后的我们，偷偷告诉你，其实，我们心里还住着一个不愿长大的小孩儿。让我们一起寻找那些年丢失的童心，分享那份纯真带来的幸福感。</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>｜时间线｜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="130">00:02:10</a>:追寻童年回忆：小学生时期的深刻记忆与欢乐时光</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="251">00:04:11</a>:小学时代的美好回忆：滑梯、算命和共同的童年回忆！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="371">00:06:11</a>:长大后的我们为什么不喜欢去游乐场了？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="648">00:10:48</a>:翻开小学的同学录，好羞耻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="811">00:13:31</a>:童年时的喜欢的动画片现在还会喜欢吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1461">00:24:21</a>:大人无处安放的童心：抽卡牌到"盲盒" 热潮：从泡泡玛特到乐高</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1787">00:29:47</a>:那些童心未泯的大人的可爱行为</span></p><span></span><p><span>-------分割线-------</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：薇塔Vitamin</span></p><span></span><p><span>玛莎拉Marcella</span></p><span></span><p><span>｜互动方式｜</span></p><span></span><p><span>微博搜索@薇塔Vitamin</span></p><span></span><p><span>Instagram: vitamagic666</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎添加我微信（vitamin821)进听友群</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmdOCHxyL9OGJ_iWVqXz9tQVsLmo.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>本节目招募嘉宾，欢迎语音文字形式投稿。</span></p><span></span><p><span>邮箱：986577856@qq.com</span></p><span></span><p><span>｜节目制作｜</span></p><span></span><p><span>logo设计/后期制作：薇塔</span></p><span></span><p><span>｜收听方式｜</span></p><span></span><p><span>国内：喜马拉雅，小宇宙，网易云音乐，</span></p><span></span><p><span>苹果播客，荔枝，qq音乐</span></p><span></span><p><span>海外：Spotify，Overcast，Pocket Casts</span></p>]]></description>
