    <title>Vol.67综艺狗血还有售后，让人看了就停不下来</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66499c9182b428eafd8d2123</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66499c9182b428eafd8d2123</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 19 May 2024 06:30:40 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><em><strong><span>本期节目给大家推荐两个最近看的好看的综艺，第一个是在波涛汹涌的大海上，一艘能够承载二十多人的帆船游艇上，九个船员形成的服务团队接待着各式各样的客人，展开了一段段独特的航程故事。从船员爱情线到客人的奇葩要求，随着最后奇葩航行的结束，狗血但又无比真实的航程落下帷幕，留给人无尽的回味和思索。</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>第二个是一群为了奖金而来的挑战者中，有人是卧底，既要抓出卧底，又要赢得奖金，最终只有一人能够胜出……</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>|时间线|</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="43">00:43</a>:【海上私生活-快意游艇】综艺推荐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="119">01:59</a>：九名船员身份介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="373">06:13</a>:看点一：船员感情线：要多狗血有多狗血</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="710">11:50</a>:看点二：奇葩同性恋客人抢女儿的男朋友</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="819">13:39</a>:霸道丑总裁的抓马求婚</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1021">17:01</a>:看点三：综艺节目到底有无剧本？这个综艺还有售后</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1225">20:25</a>:综艺推荐2【谁是内鬼？】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1380">23:00</a>：看点一：人性和金钱的考验。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1593">26:33</a>:看点二：机制设置，游戏体验感拉满</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1784">29:44</a>:看点三：结果总是意外让人意想不到！</span></p><span></span><p><span>-------分割线-------</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：薇塔Vitamin</span></p><span></span><p><span>玛莎拉Marcella</span></p><span></span><p><span>｜互动方式｜</span></p><span></span><p><span>微博搜索@薇塔Vitamin</span></p><span></span><p><span>Instagram: vitamagic666</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎添加我微信（vitamin821)进听友群</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmdOCHxyL9OGJ_iWVqXz9tQVsLmo.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>本节目招募嘉宾，欢迎语音文字形式投稿。</span></p><span></span><p><span>邮箱：986577856@qq.com</span></p><span></span><p><span>｜节目制作｜</span></p><span></span><p><span>logo设计/后期制作：薇塔</span></p><span><