    <title>Vol.64五一假期反向旅行之东北小众目的地推荐</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66225dd3200abebe6ef58d02</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66225dd3200abebe6ef58d02</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 19 Apr 2024 12:04:33 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><em><strong><span>五一出行咋就这么难？机票飞涨？酒店价格翻天？享受节假日的策略指南，游遍点到点，吃喝不用愁，住宿达人来支招！打开你的日记本，用我的建议为五一旅游做好万全的准备，从片刻的不便中找寻乐趣和美丽宝藏吧！我们一起探索旅途中未知的美丽与惊喜！</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>｜时间线｜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="36">00:36</a>:为什么五一假期的酒店住宿都贵的离谱啊，到底还让不让人出去玩啦？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【正片开始】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="301">05:01</a>:东北小众目的地推荐之我们的家乡鞍山</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="530">08:50</a>:口感鲜美，菜量超大，性价比高的餐厅，你不能错过！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="711">11:51</a>:爬山探险千山，体验温泉魅力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="954">15:54</a>:沈阳都能玩什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1171">19:31</a>本溪也能竹筏泛舟？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1221">20:21</a>:辽宁锦州：海滩与文化之旅的最佳选择</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1374">22:54</a>辽宁海边除了大连还有这么多？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1407">23:27</a>:辽宁丹东与山海关：历史文化与自然景观的完美结合！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1601">26:41</a>:体验不一样的东北之旅--通辽沙漠之旅！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1664">27:44</a>吉林能去哪？梅河口你值得拥有</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1778">29:38</a>:边境探险：打卡漠河舞厅、最北邮局</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1955">32:35</a>:探秘东北宝藏城市-长春：超便宜住宿、洗浴按摩和美食！</span></p><span></span><p><span>-------分割线-------</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：薇塔Vitamin</span></p><span></span><p><span>玛莎拉Marcella</span></p><span></span><p><span>｜互动方式｜</span></p><span></span><p><span>微博搜索@薇塔Vitamin</span></p><span></span><p><span>Instagram: vitamagic666</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎添加我微信（vitamin821)进听友群</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmdOCHxyL9OGJ_iWVqXz9tQVsLmo.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>本节目招募嘉宾，欢迎语音文字形式投稿。</span></p><span></span><p><span>邮箱：986577856@qq.com</span></p><span></span><p><span>｜节目制作｜</span></p><span></span><p><span>logo设计/后期制作：薇塔</span></p><span></span><p><span>｜收听方式｜</span></p><span></span><p><span>国内：喜马拉雅，小宇宙，网易云音乐，</span></p><span></span><p><span>苹果播客，荔枝，qq音乐</span></p><span></span><p><span>海外：Spotify，Overcast，Pocket Casts</span></p>]]></description>
