    <title>Vol.62每个人都需要一个专属于自己的房子吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66090f1f1519139e4faa513a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66090f1f1519139e4faa513a</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 31 Mar 2024 07:22:06 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><em><strong><span>一线城市租房vs三线城市买房，民宿经济革新，用纯粹体验主义拨云见日，当房产投资不再是唯一选项，洞悉身边加速轮转世界而生存消费的新态度。从巨额房贷的禁锢到数字游民的自由路径，到底什么才是真实舒适安身立命之处。</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>｜时间线｜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="135">00:02:15</a>:「私人空间的追求：人需要一个独立的房子来彻底放松」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="379">00:06:19</a>:酒店体验生活：花很少的价钱住进性价比超高的别墅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="500">00:08:20</a>:性价比高的游轮上的阳台房：原来人是可以住在十几平的房间里也会感到舒适的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="741">00:12:21</a>:民宿行业现状：价格低、投资风险大，房价萎缩导致的投资买房者预期落空！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="861">00:14:21</a>:数字游民的住宿选择与心态调适</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="982">00:16:22</a>:以行李箱为家，探讨什么才是生活必须的消费品？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1102">00:18:22</a>:突破限制，自由行走：别让住宿花销阻挡你的生活体验</span></p><span></span><p><span>-------分割线-------</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：薇塔Vitamin</span></p><span></span><p><span>｜互动方式｜</span></p><span></span><p><span>微博搜索@薇塔Vitamin</span></p><span></span><p><span>Instagram: vitamagic666</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎添加我微信（vitamin821)进听友群</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmdOCHxyL9OGJ_iWVqXz9tQVsLmo.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>本节目招募嘉宾，欢迎语音文字形式投稿。</span></p><span></span><p><span>邮箱：986577856@qq.com</span></p><span></span><p><span>｜节目制作｜</span></p><span></span><p><span>logo设计/后期制作：薇塔</span></p><span></span><p><span>｜收听方式｜</span></p><span></span><p><span>国内：喜马拉雅，小宇宙，网易云音乐，</span></p><span></span><p><span>苹果播客，荔枝，qq音乐</span></p><span></span><p><span>海外：Spotify，Overcast，Pocket Casts</span></p>]]></description>
