    <title>Vol.61神秘职场揭秘：我与高飞的空姐朋友的独家对话</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65fd7cfe1519139e4ffbd57c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65fd7cfe1519139e4ffbd57c</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 22 Mar 2024 12:43:42 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><em><strong><span>从朋友的试镜奇缘到高空“四年”的秘辛，我与空姐菲菲谈到了招聘过程中的小故事，航班上的八卦，与旅客的刁难，最重要的是，揭开了航空行业的一幕幕神秘面纱——在每段忙碌的飞行工作后，都藏着人性、爱情和梦想的小故事。就算在俯瞰云端之时，这片蔚蓝背后总是有难以言说的欢乐与艰辛。</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>|时间线|</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="62">00:01:02</a>:为什么大学毕业选择当空乘了呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="256">00:04:16</a>:为啥我每次选座的时候都没剩几个座可选了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="404">00:06:44</a>:空姐与空少的就业比例和辞职率！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1019">00:16:59</a>:空中乘务员的面试攻略：形象、年龄和身体健康的重要性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1226">00:20:26</a>:国内航空的空姐服务态度好到我都不好意思了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1635">00:27:15</a>:空姐的职业生命之工作与家庭的平衡之路</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2042">00:34:02</a>:空姐会经常遇到明星吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2248">00:37:28</a>:空姐都腰肌劳损与腰间盘突出</span></p><span></span><p><span>-------分割线-------</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：薇塔Vitamin</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：菲菲，前国内知名航空公司空姐</span></p><span></span><p><span>｜互动方式｜</span></p><span></span><p><span>微博搜索@薇塔Vitamin</span></p><span></span><p><span>Instagram: vitamagic666</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书：vitamagic</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎添加我的微信（vitamin821)与我联系，加听友群</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmdOCHxyL9OGJ_iWVqXz9tQVsLmo.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>本节目招募嘉宾，欢迎语音文字形式投稿。</span></p><span></span><p><span>邮箱：986577856@qq.com</span></p><span></span><p><span>｜节目制作｜</span></p><span></span><p><span>logo设计/后期制作：薇塔</span></p><span></span><p><span>｜收听方式｜</span></p><span></span><p><span>国内：喜马拉雅，小宇宙，网易云音乐，</span></p><span></span><p><span>苹果播客，荔枝，qq音乐</span></p><span></span><p><span>海外：Spotify，Overcast，Pocket Casts</span></p>]]></description>
