  <item>
    <title>Vol.60美签攻略：成功拿下游轮工作必备签证</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65f31ffd696bd9a8793ee6f1</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65f31ffd696bd9a8793ee6f1</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 14 Mar 2024 16:04:11 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><em><strong><span>你也想环游世界吗？听我说说怎样一举拿下游轮工作所需的美国签证（B1/B2商务/旅游签证，C1D海员签证）。盘点外交规则，从资料准备到背后故事，经验分享让你在签证旅途上不再迷茫。面试当日，携带重要文件，心怀真诚，先声夺人，是成功的关键。千万别怕排长队与使馆大门外的朝霞，早起的鸟儿先拿签！</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>｜时间线｜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="133">00:02:13</a>:美国签证必备材料清单及排队经验分享</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="255">00:04:15</a>:签证攻略：揭秘北京美国大使馆签证过程中的常见问题！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="375">00:06:15</a>:北京美国大使馆签证：排队两小时的艰辛经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="496">00:08:16</a>:签证面试官的问话技巧：如何回答才能通过面试？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="618">00:10:18</a>:成功签证的经验分享：如何准备资料和面试技巧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="739">00:12:19</a>:美国签证面试揭秘：真正影响签证通过率的因素！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="860">00:14:20</a>:“美国签证申请攻略：如何准备资料和避免常见错误？”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="981">00:16:21</a>:北美到南美，美签十年有效，解锁多个目的地！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1102">00:18:22</a>:签证排队时的意外惊喜与感动</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1224">00:20:24</a>:排了两个小时的签证队伍，出来的那一刻感动不已！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1344">00:22:24</a>:北京签证攻略：排队时间两个小时，早去早解脱！</span></p><span></span><p><span>-------分割线-------</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：薇塔Vitamin</span></p><span></span><p><span>心理学硕士在读</span></p><span></span><p><span>｜互动方式｜</span></p><span></span><p><span>微博搜索@薇塔Vitamin</span></p><span></span><p><span>Instagram: vitamagic666</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎添加我的微信（vitamin821)进听友群</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmdOCHxyL9OGJ_iWVqXz9tQVsLmo.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>本节目招募嘉宾，欢迎语音文字形式投稿。</span></p><span></span><p><span>邮箱：986577856@qq.com</span></p><span></